{"parivyaveByaH kriyaH": [{"id": "parivyaveByaH kriyaH", "headword": "परिव्यवेभ्यः क्रियः", "headword_slp1": "parivyaveByaH kriyaH", "fold": "parivyaveByaH kriyaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "After the verb क्री 'to purchase', when preceded by परि , वि or अव , the आत्मनेपद affix is employed, even when the fruit of the action does not accrue to the agent.\n\nTerms: आत्मनेपद", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["परिव्यवेभ्यः क्रियः १.३.१८", "१.३.१८", "१.३.१८ परिव्यवेभ्यः क्रियः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["parivyaveByaH kriyaH १.३.१८", "१.३.१८", "१.३.१८ parivyaveByaH kriyaH"]}], "parermfsaH": [{"id": "parermfzaH", "headword": "परेर्मृषः", "headword_slp1": "parermfzaH", "fold": "parermfsaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "After the verb मृष् 'to bear', preceded by परि , परस्मैपद is used when the fruit of the action accrues to the agent.\n\nTerms: परस्मैपद", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["परेर्मृषः १.३.८२", "१.३.८२", "१.३.८२ परेर्मृषः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["parermfzaH १.३.८२", "१.३.८२", "१.३.८२ parermfzaH"]}], "parajerasoQaH": [{"id": "parAjerasoQaH", "headword": "पराजेरसोढः", "headword_slp1": "parAjerasoQaH", "fold": "parajerasoQaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In the case of the verb पराजि 'to be tired or weary of', that which becomes unbearable, is called अपादान कारक।\n\nTerms: कारक-अपादान", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["पराजेरसोढः १.४.२६", "१.४.२६", "१.४.२६ पराजेरसोढः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["parAjerasoQaH १.४.२६", "१.४.२६", "१.४.२६ parAjerasoQaH"]}], "parikrayaRe sampradanamanyatarasyam": [{"id": "parikrayaRe sampradAnamanyatarasyAm", "headword": "परिक्रयणे सम्प्रदानमन्यतरस्याम्", "headword_slp1": "parikrayaRe sampradAnamanyatarasyAm", "fold": "parikrayaRe sampradanamanyatarasyam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In the case of hiring on wages, that which is especially auxiliary in the accomplishment of the action of the verb परिक्री 'employing on stipulated wages', is optionally called सम्प्रदान or receipient.\n\nTerms: कारक-करण", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["परिक्रयणे सम्प्रदानमन्यतरस्याम् १.४.४४", "१.४.४४", "१.४.४४ परिक्रयणे सम्प्रदानमन्यतरस्याम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["parikrayaRe sampradAnamanyatarasyAm १.४.४४", "१.४.४४", "१.४.४४ parikrayaRe sampradAnamanyatarasyAm"]}], "paraH sanikarsaH sanhita": [{"id": "paraH saMnikarzaH saMhitA", "headword": "परः संनिकर्षः संहिता", "headword_slp1": "paraH saMnikarzaH saMhitA", "fold": "paraH sanikarsaH sanhita", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The closest proximity of letters, there being the intervention of half a मात्रा or prosodial length between them, is called contact or संहिता।\n\nTerms:", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["परः संनिकर्षः संहिता १.४.१०९", "१.४.१०९", "१.४.१०९ परः संनिकर्षः संहिता"], "synonyms_slp1": ["paraH saMnikarzaH saMhitA १.४.१०९", "१.४.१०९", "१.४.१०९ paraH saMnikarzaH saMhitA"]}], "pare maDye sasWya va": [{"id": "pAre maDye zazWyA vA", "headword": "पारे मध्ये षष्ठ्या वा", "headword_slp1": "pAre maDye zazWyA vA", "fold": "pare maDye sasWya va", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The words पार 'across' and मध्य 'middle' may optionally be compounded with a word ending in the 6th-Case-affix, when they take forms परे and मध्ये and the compound so formed is अव्ययीभाव।\n\nTerms: समास-अव्ययीभाव", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["पारे मध्ये षष्ठ्या वा २.१.१८", "२.१.१८", "२.१.१८ पारे मध्ये षष्ठ्या वा"], "synonyms_slp1": ["pAre maDye zazWyA vA २.१.१८", "२.१.१८", "२.१.१८ pAre maDye zazWyA vA"]}], "paravaliNgan dvandvatatpurusayoH": [{"id": "paravalliNgaM dvandvatatpuruzayoH", "headword": "परवल्लिङ्गं द्वन्द्वतत्पुरुषयोः", "headword_slp1": "paravalliNgaM dvandvatatpuruzayoH", "fold": "paravaliNgan dvandvatatpurusayoH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The gender of द्वन्द compound or तत्-पुरुष compound is like that of the last word in it.\n\nTerms: समास-द्वन्द-gender", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["परवल्लिङ्गं द्वन्द्वतत्पुरुषयोः २.४.२६", "२.४.२६", "२.४.२६ परवल्लिङ्गं द्वन्द्वतत्पुरुषयोः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["paravalliNgaM dvandvatatpuruzayoH २.४.२६", "२.४.२६", "२.४.२६ paravalliNgaM dvandvatatpuruzayoH"]}], "parasca": [{"id": "paraSca", "headword": "परश्च", "headword_slp1": "paraSca", "fold": "parasca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "And subsequent.\n\nTerms: अधिकार", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["परश्च ३.१.२", "३.१.२", "३.१.२ परश्च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["paraSca ३.१.२", "३.१.२", "३.१.२ paraSca"]}], "parimaRe pacaH": [{"id": "parimARe pacaH", "headword": "परिमाणे पचः", "headword_slp1": "parimARe pacaH", "fold": "parimaRe pacaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix खश् comes after the verb पच् 'to cook' when the object in composition with it denotes a measure.\n\nTerms: खश्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["परिमाणे पचः ३.२.३३", "३.२.३३", "३.२.३३ परिमाणे पचः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["parimARe pacaH ३.२.३३", "३.२.३३", "३.२.३३ parimARe pacaH"]}], "parokse liw": [{"id": "parokze liw", "headword": "परोक्षे लिट्", "headword_slp1": "parokze liw", "fold": "parokse liw", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix लिट् (Perfect Tense) comes after the verb in the sense of the past before the commencement of the current dayand unperceived by the narrator.\n\nTerms: लिट्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["परोक्षे लिट् ३.२.११५", "३.२.११५", "३.२.११५ परोक्षे लिट्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["parokze liw ३.२.११५", "३.२.११५", "३.२.११५ parokze liw"]}], "parimaRaKyayan sarveByaH": [{"id": "parimARAKyAyAM sarveByaH", "headword": "परिमाणाख्यायां सर्वेभ्यः", "headword_slp1": "parimARAKyAyAM sarveB