e affix घञ् comes after the root ग्रह् 'to seize' in composition with परि when it relates to sacrificial subjects.\n\nTerms: घञ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["परौ यज्ञे ३.३.४७", "३.३.४७", "३.३.४७ परौ यज्ञे"], "synonyms_slp1": ["parO yajYe ३.३.४७", "३.३.४७", "३.३.४७ parO yajYe"]}], "parO BuvovajYane": [{"id": "parO Buvo'vajYAne", "headword": "परौ भुवोऽवज्ञाने", "headword_slp1": "parO Buvo'vajYAne", "fold": "parO BuvovajYane", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix घञ् is optionally used after the verb भू 'to be', the word परि being in construction and the sense of the word so formed being 'disregard'.\n\nTerms: घञ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["परौ भुवोऽवज्ञाने ३.३.५५", "३.३.५५", "३.३.५५ परौ भुवोऽवज्ञाने"], "synonyms_slp1": ["parO Buvo'vajYAne ३.३.५५", "३.३.५५", "३.३.५५ parO Buvo'vajYAne"]}], "parO GaH": [{"id": "parO GaH", "headword": "परौ घः", "headword_slp1": "parO GaH", "fold": "parO GaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix क also comes after a root हन् 'to kill' when the उपसर्ग परि is in composition and the relation between the word so formed and the verb is that of an instrument and घ replaces हन् ।\n\nTerms: क", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["परौ घः ३.३.८४", "३.३.८४", "३.३.८४ परौ घः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["parO GaH ३.३.८४", "३.३.८४", "३.३.८४ parO GaH"]}], "paryayarharRotpatisu Rvuc": [{"id": "paryAyArharRotpattizu Rvuc", "headword": "पर्यायार्हर्णोत्पत्तिषु ण्वुच्", "headword_slp1": "paryAyArharRotpattizu Rvuc", "fold": "paryayarharRotpatisu Rvuc", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix ण्वुच् comes optionally after a root in the sense of succession, merit, debt or production.\n\nTerms: ण्वुच्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["पर्यायार्हर्णोत्पत्तिषु ण्वुच् ३.३.१११", "३.३.१११", "३.३.१११ पर्यायार्हर्णोत्पत्तिषु ण्वुच्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["paryAyArharRotpattizu R